OL,3,GNEWSARecord mountain callouts not
OL,4,Asustainable, rescuers warn
OL,5,
OL,6,FMountain rescuers are calling for a
OL,7,F"serious conversation" to reverse the
OL,8,Frising number of callouts and are
OL,9,Furging walkers to take "personal
OL,10,Fresponsibility" for their actions.
OL,12,FAugust was the busiest month on record
OL,13,Ffor Llanberis Mountain Rescue Team
OL,14,F(LMRT) with 59 emergencies in Eryri,
OL,15,Falso known as Snowdonia.
OL,17,FAnnual callouts have risen every year
OL,18,Fsince crowds queued on the summit of Yr
OL,19,FWyddfa, or Snowdon, during the Covid
OL,20,Flockdown.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
